# Test fixtures ARE tracked (test_data/) — deliberate.
# They are hand-written INPUTS that the extraction harness reads, and a harness
# that cannot run from a clean checkout is not a regression guard. These are the
# only documents that exercise the large-document / chunking path.
# Generated outputs stay ignored — see data/output/ above.
